  "caption": "Notice that the security researcher (top right) never connects to the target web server directly. Every finding comes from querying Google's index — which Googlebot populated by visiting the target's public URLs. The target has no knowledge that this reconnaissance is happening. The only direct path to the target in this diagram is the crawler visits — and those are initiated by Google, not the researcher. This is what makes Google Dorking a purely passive technique.",
